{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0423_1000_p", "source_sha256": "4c285d2cd41f55d867b6b0d9774aa352c01c8a86166e9ef5426e90ab262b52c2", "ja": "（グラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影で、\nやよいは寝かしつけられている姿を撮ることになった）", "zh": "（这是在拍摄写真杂志《爱格拉！！》，要拍摄弥生被哄睡的样子）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0423_1001_005yay", "source_sha256": "405a14289a3a87d1d3451d914d7ac54bf6c4b5fbf23c40f1bd4f7bf07d3b04d5", "ja": "私が寝かしつけられるほうなんて、\nちょっとドキドキしちゃいます！", "zh": "要我来扮演被哄睡的那一方，\n好让人小鹿乱撞呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0423_1002_p", "source_sha256": "2f77a261ddc1ac57690a81c81c9dba8084ffe812424384b1dc3da918cd478408", "ja": "緊張……というより、なんだか嬉しそうだな。\nもしかして、この撮影、楽しみにしてたのか？", "zh": "与其说是紧张，不如说看起来有点开心啊。难道你一直很期待这次拍摄吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0423_1003_005yay", "source_sha256": "8fa0eaafed5bf31269255528de05489f2620e510caa96553e63e0ff698aa150d", "ja": "はい！　あんまりないことだから新鮮で……。\nしてもらったとき、どんな感じなんだろうなーって♪", "zh": "是的！因为平时很少有这样的机会，所以觉得很新鲜……  \n我一直在想，如果让别人哄睡的话，会是什么感觉呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0423_1004_005yay", "source_sha256": "d00f7fbbd7c43908713ad2ae39118c3c903fe00cdba91eef6af9125bed84f0b5", "ja": "それに、今度弟たちの寝かしつけをするときの\n参考にできたらなーって思ったんです！", "zh": "而且，我想要是能给下次哄弟弟们睡觉时作参考就好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0423_1005_p", "source_sha256": "306443ba48e5b4a4e2d04511e20f01518ed17cd3a3222c6af116bb039cfa3cf5", "ja": "なるほどな……やよいのことだから、\n寝かしつけも上手そうだけど。", "zh": "原来如此……毕竟是弥生，\n哄人睡觉应该也很在行吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0423_1006_005yay", "source_sha256": "781e002d1e6dc285d6a0d619a05c896042e43857699d3017bcf2348861d9acc8", "ja": "うーん……自分じゃあんまりわかんないですけど。\nでも、妹も弟もよく眠れる！って言ってくれます！", "zh": "嗯……我自己不太清楚呢。\n不过，妹妹和弟弟都说我哄他们睡觉很厉害！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0423_1007_005yay", "source_sha256": "8e6dab5540a7b0376e71bf601ab7424689a7b20034fbe62d8a226a4f4ad778c3", "ja": "あ、でも弟たちもすっごく上手なんですよ！\nみんなでお互いにぽんぽんってし合ったりしてて……。", "zh": "啊，不过弟弟们也特别擅长哦！大家会互相轻轻拍拍什么的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0423_1008_005yay", "source_sha256": "5a71d7f8949856472fd73259fad7b28f68b719c9d656181d247b78294d1b9689", "ja": "ぽんぽんして、ぽんぽんされて、リラックスして、\nとってもかわいいなーって。", "zh": "互相拍拍，放松下来，感觉特别可爱呢——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0423_1009_p", "source_sha256": "53b6edc0a58276db7cc9f22f728651d587b5be7630b3027d649e880d3b87bc04", "ja": "確かに……すごく癒される光景になりそうだな。", "zh": "确实……感觉会是非常治愈的画面呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0423_1010_005yay", "source_sha256": "fc785cc5b50a1ac1d541812af8c62142b7afacff4d954f2f7cf74ecb9936fbfd", "ja": "ですよね！　……あっ！\n{$P$}、わかりました！", "zh": "对吧！……啊！\n{$P$}，我明白了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0423_1011_p", "source_sha256": "4a1d551ab646617d03efccc94f7122d8bf82465ab0545fbee3315e0d6520ee73", "ja": "ん？　なにが分かったんだ？", "zh": "嗯？你明白什么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0423_1012_005yay", "source_sha256": "eab0486221674657e2998cafaf5e4b5b18ed08467bde9a22b1998ca368463c6d", "ja": "どんな気持ちで撮影に挑めばいいかです！\nあんまり気負わずにリラックスして、それで……", "zh": "我知道该抱着怎样的心情来拍摄了！不要太过紧张，放松下来，然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0423_1013_005yay", "source_sha256": "243eb8a6e94bcbcebfe02c73cb3ed478f8c19b88835b58802690847a6ac840cd", "ja": "私が弟たちの寝かしつけ合いを見てるときみたいな気持\nちに、見てくれる人もなってくれたらいいなーって！", "zh": "就像我看着弟弟妹妹们互相哄对方睡觉时的那种心情，要是看的人也能有同样的感受就好了——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0423_1014_p", "source_sha256": "0a0470381ae5c04c99808a4bba3a394792ceb14b6a8268039c31ff7049db7d2a", "ja": "うん、いいと思う！　やよいなら、\nきっと癒される最高のショットも狙えるぞ！", "zh": "嗯，我觉得不错！要是弥生的话，\n一定能拍到让人感到治愈的绝佳照片！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0423_1015_005yay", "source_sha256": "b075384a46f97aaf0ac2d271f8c23597e113d9779c883364e97903e9d73a8422", "ja": "本当ですか？　えへへ、じゃあ、頑張ってきまーす！\n……じゃなくて、リラックスしてきまーす！　えへへ♪", "zh": "真的吗？嘿嘿，那我会加油的——！\n……不对，我会放松一下的——！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
